WEBVTT

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:01.740
Nik: Why create temporary tables at all?

00:00:01.848 --> 00:00:05.381
Nik: You're basically already falling
from the cliff

00:00:05.381 --> 00:00:07.148
and just lie down there on the bottom.

00:00:07.324 --> 00:00:11.497
Kirk: "Hey, just confirm that you know
you have to update your cache here,

00:00:11.497 --> 00:00:13.584
because somebody created a temp table."

00:00:13.704 --> 00:00:19.040
Nik: Less than 4,000 for temporary tables
which are created per transaction.

00:00:19.104 --> 00:00:20.540
Nik: Just don't use temp tables.

00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:27.840
[music]

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:34.840
[music]

