giant query, just forget it.

00:09:13.736 --> 00:09:18.916
You won't get the performance we get,
okay? Our average search speeds with like,

00:09:18.956 --> 00:09:23.456
two different like fields, et cetera,
is, like, 30 milliseconds, okay?

00:09:23.456 --> 00:09:28.156
Across the 200 million row table
that's being updated in real time.

00:09:28.656 --> 00:09:31.556
- Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm
- it crushes this kind of performance.

00:09:31.556 --> 00:09:35.796
We tried doing, letting the optimizer
